; Signed by BIND 9.20.29 (dnssec-signzone, ECDSAP256SHA256, NSEC), then
; rewritten one record per line by named-compilezone -s full. Owner names
; and RDATA names are in mixed case; BIND keeps the case of the NSEC next
; names and of the SVCB / HTTPS targets in the signed data
; (RFC 6840 §5.1). Every RRSIG here must verify. UPSTREAM_FEEDBACK.md UF-008.
